# Catalog — submitted images are read-only

When building or updating catalog fichas (`src/content/catalog/`, `/coleccion/`, `/en/collection/`):

- **Do not replace** user-submitted photos with Wikimedia, auction, NGC/PCGS, or other external images.
- **Do not edit** the photograph (no cropping slabs/holders, no compositing separate faces, no placeholders).
- **If the file is missing**, ask the user to attach or commit it — do not substitute.

Full workflow: `.cursor/skills/catalog-submitted-images/SKILL.md`
